Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:41:01 +0530
Subject: nord: fix machine name in SA8797P Ride config yaml

Drop the Embedded suffix from the machine key so it matches the
machine name reported at runtime for the SA8797P-Ride platform,
keeping DSP_LIBRARY_PATH unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Anandu Krishnan E <anandu.e@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-sa8797p-ride-embedded.yaml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-sa8797p-ride-embedded.yaml b/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-sa8797p-ride-embedded.yaml
index 1edbf72..a8be139 100644
--- a/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-sa8797p-ride-embedded.yaml
+++ b/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-sa8797p-ride-embedded.yaml
@@ -2,5 +2,5 @@
 # Copyright (c) Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.
 # yaml-language-server: $schema=schema.json
 machines:
-  Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. SA8797P Ride Embedded:
+  Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. SA8797P Ride:
     DSP_LIBRARY_PATH: nord/Qualcomm/SA8797P-Ride-Embedded/dsp
